     1	"""Halpin's relational mapping (Rmap) of a loaded GND model.
     2	
     3	The normative rules have one home: "Relational mapping (Rmap)" in
     4	``gnd-orm-core/references/representation-format.md``. This module implements
     5	them; it reads a loaded :class:`gnd.model.Model` and returns a deterministic
     6	:class:`RelationalSchema`. It never raises for an admitted model: whatever it
     7	cannot place becomes an :class:`Unmapped` row with a closed reason.
     8	"""
